<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH MAY REAL INDUSTRIAL SALES -0.7 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>CZECH MAY REAL INDUSTRIAL SALES -0.7 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech real industrial sales fell 0.7 percent year-on-year in May versus a rise of 10.1 percent in April, preliminary figures from the Czech Statistical Bureau (CSU) showed on Monday.</p>
<p>The CSU added in a statement that nominal industrial wages were 11.9 percent higher, year-on-year, in May.</p>
</text>
